 "why_it_fails": {
  "source": "objective.py",
  "note": "FastICA is not losing to the optimiser or to sample size: at N=10000 its solution scores HIGHER on the ICA contrast than the pixel-aligned basis does, so the pixel basis is not the optimum being searched for.  The pixel-aligned basis was mapped into the sample-white coordinates and Lowdin-orthogonalised to make it feasible (|B-Q|_max = 0.364).",
